[0015] FIG. 1 illustrates an embodiment of a system configured to generate a dynamic video based on visited webpage sections;
[0016] FIG. 2 illustrates an example operational flow of the system of FIG. 1 for generating dynamic videos based on HTML code of visited sections of a website;
[0017] FIG. 3 illustrates an example flowchart of a method to generate a dynamic video based on webpage sections;
